A||N||5||2xsess||Odd Fiero Siting (long)||||4||
Z||000000||2xsess||11-29-2000||03:31 PM||||As some of you may know I'm in the Army and where I'm stationed right now I think there are like a total of five Fieros around locally,mine,SDM1964,and Bholdwick being three of them. <BR>Today I got the fun job of driving around the post in a hummer picking up the trash on the side of the roads. <BR>As I was going down one side road I saw the rear end of what looked like a beautiful white GT, non-spoiler. I couldn't turn around so I drove on wondering where someone had been hiding this beauty. <BR>After lunch we were cruising around the same area and I saw it again,  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"> it was sweet, all white with what looked like white lace wheels. Now here's the odd part, It had 87-88coupe/88formula bumper covers on it. Now I don't think that it looked odd it's just that I have been seeing pics of this and I really wanted to see it in person. It looked great. OF course he was going the opposite way of me and I didn't get to stop him to talk to him but I'll be keeping an eye out for that little beauty. Hopefully he's online and I can get him here  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Sorry it's so long, just had to share my excitement  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Jeff<P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/My_car_(large)sig_1.JPG"> ||||reg||4
Z||000001||RiceCooker||11-29-2000||06:11 PM||||White wheels with white lace?<P>Sounds like Eric Marsh's Monster V8 Car.<BR>The one with the bundle on snakes headers<BR>I do not know how to post a link.<BR>||||reg||1
