Z||000003||2xsess||11-30-2000||07:48 AM||||Nope that's not it. Too bad, it would be awesome having that beast runing around here toasting all the riceboys, blowing their fartcans off and all  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>The one I saw had a Formula front bumper cover and nothing on the decklid at all. The whels looked like factory GT lace with the lace painted white.<P>||||reg||1
