Z||000005||2xsess||11-30-2000||11:39 PM||||LMAO yea right civilian HUMMV hahahaha that's too funny. <BR>Well, just to let you in on the joke, The military Hummers are not at all like the civilian ones, the interior consists of a steering wheel and two really freaking uncomfortable unadjustable seats. basic push-pull type heater controls. and that's about it. <P><B>GO ARMY HOOAH!</B><P><P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/My_car_(large)sig_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
